- [0xC0, 0xAF] overlong → error_len Some(1) → port emits 1 FFFD, then rest = [0xAF] → 0xAF is a continuation byte alone → error_len Some(1) → another FFFD. So the port actually emits 2 FFFDs! Same as Node (2 FFFDs).

